	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader8b_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『うむ
むかしを　おもいだしてね▼
わたしは　こうけいしゃを　さがし
せかいじゅうを　たびした▼
とおく　はなれた
りゅうのさと　も……▼
そこで　アイリス
きみと　であったね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T06:32:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T02:39:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『うむ
昔を　おもいだしてね▼
後継者を　探し
わたしは　世界中を　旅した▼
遠く　離れた
竜の里も……▼
そこで　アイリス
きみと　出会ったね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T08:12:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T02:39:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T04:34:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER8B
シャガ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T04:33:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T09:06:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
