				Time="2011-09-05T04:34:46" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER8W
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T04:33:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
